# Clubs 💬

**Clubs** is a free, privacy-focused messaging platform built for simple and secure communication.

It allows users to communicate privately with individuals or create **Clubs** — group conversations where multiple people can connect and chat together.

## ✨ Features

* 💬 **Private Messaging** — Chat directly with other users.
* 👥 **Clubs** — Create and participate in group conversations.
* 🔐 **Privacy Focused** — Designed with user privacy as a core principle.
* 🆓 **Completely Free** — No paid messaging features.
* 🎨 **Clean & Modern UI** — Simple interface focused on communication.
* 📱 **Responsive Design** — Designed to work across different screen sizes.

## 🏠 How Clubs Works

### 1. Create an Account

Create your account and set up your profile.

### 2. Chat Privately

Find another user and start a one-to-one conversation.

### 3. Create a Club

Create a Club for your friends, classmates, team, community, or any group you want.

### 4. Invite People

Share your unique Club information with others so they can join.

### 5. Start Messaging

Once members join, everyone can communicate inside the Club.

## 🔒 Privacy

Privacy is one of the main goals of Clubs.

The project is designed to provide users with a messaging experience where personal communication and group conversations are kept private.

> **Your conversations should belong to you.**

